) canal is a key trade route between Europe and Asia.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Suez_Canal","source":"Wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"places":[{"title":"Egypt","extract":"Egypt, officially the Arab Republic of Egypt, is a country spanning the northeast corner of Africa and southwest corner of Asia via the Sinai Peninsula. It is bordered by the Mediterranean Sea to the north, Palestine and Israel to the northeast, the Red Sea to the east, Sudan and the Sahara to the south, and Libya to the west. The Gulf of Aqaba in the northeast separates Egypt from Jordan and Saudi Arabia. Cairo is the capital, largest city, and leading cultural centre, while Alexandria is the second-largest city and an important hub of industry and tourism. With over 107 million inhabitants, Egypt is the most populous country in the Arab world, third-most populous country in Africa, and 15th-most populated in the world.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Egypt","source":"Wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","iso2":"EG"}],"arc":{"reports":38,"first_seen":"2026-10-12T12:54:33Z","first_title":"News Shippers stressing over risks from Suez Canal and Red Sea transits","first_url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxOdjQ4azJ2UWFoRWpuYVR4X1RKdHAwVkF1azZHX3IzYXNYSXBRbURiWjdkSzl2SEpHdzJIU2ZwVkJPSGFoZHlpclhGVE9FcGRxeWFpTU9hbGl1NktDcHFSU0l6Z09FOUZXTlpVaWZKdFBSazA4LUk5X0pjSmNPQ0hLQzE0dUtkSmpHOW5TRlFTdm9Nd0ZESnc?oc=5","first_publisher":"The Loadstar","earlier":[{"id":"e_904925b4c5d2","title":"20th crude oil tanker transits Suez Canal, heads to South Korea","date":"2026-11-01T02:25:09Z","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE5PcUFKaFNsaHZPMF9UYm9VTHJPNkotemlZRmxvZHFHTnpNemxDWGVpQU51WFFXb0R0X3dJc3BGNnptUnhBZmZGa2tLTjZ5ZHpJemRoNWFmUQ?oc=5","publisher":"헤럴드경제","verification":"single_source_report"},{"id":"e_0a233ca28f07","title":"Maersk to resume Suez Canal sailings on India-Europe service","date":"2026-11-02T09:28:15Z","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","publ